<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Magnum 1996 net up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Magnum 1996 net up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     19.0    vs	16.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		283.82   vs     240.53</p>
<p>    Turnover		2,793.64   vs   2,332.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  438.98   vs     384.04</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less 18.22   vs less 19.43</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  31.55   vs	 8.95</p>
<p>    Total dividend (pct)   10.0    vs	 6.67</p>
<p>Note - Magnum Corp Bhd is involved in gaming, property and credit business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
